  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreFoxVariantsAPI/blob/master/img/title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"標誌\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreFoxVariantsAPI/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/895334913560178698/1118530263329288362/wiki.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreFoxVariantsAPI/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/895334913560178698/915683907649822750/reportissue.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmfvapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/FGPy4Dsn?logo=modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmfvapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/game-versions/FGPy4Dsn?logo=modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mfvapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_1502909_downloads.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mfvapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1502909.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"版本\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>簡介</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>輕量級 API，供其他模組新增狐狸變種使用，同時能保持彼此間的相容性</li>\n<li>本身不會額外新增任何變種</li>\n<li>提供透過自訂標籤在生物群系中新增狐狸生成的機制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>模組推薦</strong></h1>\n<p>開發中</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>一般資訊</strong></h1>\n<h2><strong>召喚指令</strong></h2>\n<p>現在可以使用字串值作為「variant」NBT 來召喚狐狸。</p>\n<p>這與 Minecraft 在其他地方廣泛使用的命名空間系統類似，但該系統並未用於某些實體變種（包含狐狸）。</p>\n<p>例如，召喚原版雪地變種的方式如下：</p>\n<pre><code>/summon minecraft:fox ~ ~ ~ {variant:\"minecraft:snow\"}</code></pre>\n<p>若要召來自自訂模組的變種，則如下：</p>\n<pre><code>/summon minecraft:fox ~ ~ ~ {variant:\"modid:variant\"}</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>給模組開發者的資訊</strong></h1>\n<p>關於使用此 API 進行模組開發的詳細資訊，請參考 <a href=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreFoxVariantsAPI/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
